# Installation

Multiple distribution methods to fit your deployment workflow.

{% grid cols=2 %}
{% card title="Cargo Install" icon="package" description="Install directly from crates.io" %}
{% codeblock code="cargo install wallhack" /%}
{% /card %}

{% card title="Build from Source" icon="cube" description="Compile with cargo build" %}
{% codeblock code="cargo build --release" /%}
{% /card %}
{% /grid %}

{% separator /%}

## Cross-Compilation

Build for multiple target platforms using cross.

{% card title="Target Platforms" icon="desktop" description="Compile for different operating systems and architectures" %}

**Linux (musl)**

{% codeblock code="cross build --release --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl" /%}

**Windows**

{% codeblock code="cross build --release --target x86_64-pc-windows-gnu" /%}

{% /card %}
